    <string name="pc_control_help">RUN:\nadb shell am broadcast -a %1$s -n %2$s/.core.MicrodroidReceiver --es automation_id all\n\nIMPORT .java (needs \u201cAllow ADB imports\u201d ON):\n... ACTION_PLUGIN_IMPORT --es path /storage/emulated/0/Download/x.java\n\nAll commands need explicit -n on Android 8+.</string>
    <string name="pc_control_help_full">RUN:\nadb shell am broadcast -a %1$s -n %2$s/.core.MicrodroidReceiver --es automation_id all\n\nTRIGGERS (base64 JSON):\n... ACTION_SET_TRIGGERS --es automation_id x --es triggers_b64 &lt;b64&gt;\n\nEVENT:\n... ACTION_EVENT --es event_type screen --es event_json_b64 &lt;b64&gt;\n\nIMPORT .java (needs \u201cAllow ADB imports\u201d ON):\n... ACTION_PLUGIN_IMPORT --es path /storage/emulated/0/Download/x.java\n\nAll commands need explicit -n on Android 8+.</string>

